---
---

<section class="roadmap section reveal" id="roadmap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="roadmap-header reveal delay-100">
      <div class="badge glow-badge" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <span class="badge-text">Roadmap • v1.1.0 &amp; Beyond</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built to stay <span class="accent-text">rock-solid.</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">With <strong>v1.1.0</strong> hardening the core compiler, authenticated v2 vaults, diagnostics, and verified releases, GitSetu’s next milestones focus on external SSH agents, core consolidation, and wider distribution.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Foundation Baseline Banner -->
    <div class="baseline-banner reveal delay-150">
      <div class="baseline-badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
        <span>Shipped in v1.1.0</span>
      </div>
      <p class="baseline-desc">Authenticated Vault v2 (PBKDF2 600k + AES-256-CTR + HMAC-SHA256) • Remote-URL Routing (<code>--remote</code>) • <code>explain</code>, <code>audit</code> &amp; <code>import</code> • Native OS HTTPS Delegation • JSON &amp; Porcelain API • Atomic Directory Locking • Verified GitHub Releases &amp; npm</p>
      <a href="/docs/reference/changelog" class="baseline-link">Read full v1.1.0 Changelog →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="roadmap-grid">
      <!-- Roadmap Item 1 -->
      <div class="roadmap-card reveal delay-200">
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accent-icon"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Hardened Core &amp; Observability</h3>
        <p>Strict v2 registries, remote-URL <code>includeIf</code> routing, <code>explain</code> &amp; <code>audit</code> diagnostics, native OS credential delegation, tri-state <code>inherit</code> signing, and AI Agent Skill.</p>
        <span class="status-label status-shipped">Shipped in v1.1.0</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Roadmap Item 2 -->
      <div class="roadmap-card reveal delay-300">
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accent-icon"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>External Agents &amp; Distribution</h3>
        <p>Core consolidation (<a href="/docs/adr/0003-fut03-codebase-consolidation-architecture">ADR 0003</a>), 1Password / Bitwarden / Secretive SSH agent support, identity-aware <code>gitsetu clone</code>, and community channels (Homebrew, Scoop, WinGet, AUR, Nix).</p>
        <span class="status-label status-next">Next: v1.2.0</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Roadmap Item 3 -->
      <div class="roadmap-card reveal delay-400">
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accent-icon"><path d="M21.5 2v6h-6M2.5 22v-6h6M2 11.5a10 10 0 0 1 18.8-4.3M22 12.5a10 10 0 0 1-18.8 4.3"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Ecosystem &amp; Enterprise</h3>
        <p>Interactive Web Config Visualizer, <code>fzf</code> switcher, VS Code &amp; JetBrains status integration, automated key rotation reminders, and ephemeral CI/CD identity runners.</p>
        <span class="status-label">Phase 2 &amp; 3</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .roadmap {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .roadmap::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-accent), transparent);
  }

  .roadmap-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-2xl) auto;
  }

  .baseline-banner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-3xl) auto;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .baseline-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-success);
  }

  .baseline-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .baseline-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .baseline-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  .roadmap-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .roadmap-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    position: relative;
    transition: transform var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base);
  }

  .roadmap-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 20px rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.05);
    border-color: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.3);
  }

  .roadmap-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.05);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.2);
  }

  .roadmap-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .roadmap-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .status-label {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .status-shipped {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    color: var(--color-success);
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .status-next {
    background: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    border-color: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.3);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .roadmap-card a {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .roadmap-card code,
  .baseline-desc code {
    background: var(--bg-code);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88em;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .roadmap-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
